WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.868
-Now, Nicole, we've known
each other a long time,

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.203
and I think I know
you pretty well,

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.605
but I was hoping to get
to know you a little better.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:08.975
It is time for "50 Yes Or No's."

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.043
♪♪

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.611
-♪ "50 Yes Or No's" ♪

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:16.516
♪ "50 Yes Or No's" ♪

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.485
-Are you ready for this? Okay.
-Yeah, I'm ready.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:21.987 line:0%
Yeah.
-Were you born in Hawaii?

00:00:21.987 --> 00:00:23.089 line:0%
Yes.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.223 line:0%
-Did you grow up in Sydney,
Australia.

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.226 line:0%
-Oh, sorry.
It feels like we're on a --

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:28.227 line:0%
Yeah, no, I'll just -- Yes.

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:29.795 line:0%
-Do you know how to surf?
-Bodysurf.

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:31.463 line:0%
-Ever been to the
Sydney Opera House?

00:00:31.463 --> 00:00:33.600 line:0%
-Yes. I was there
two nights ago.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.168 line:0%
-Do you like opera?
-Yes, I was seeing an opera.

00:00:36.168 --> 00:00:38.337 line:0%
-Really?
-Dude, is this planned?

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:39.939 line:0%
-Did you study ballet
in high school?

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.274 line:0%
-High school.
-Do you like being Australian?

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:44.544 line:0%
-I'm Australian
and I'm American.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.012 line:0%
-Is summer better than fall?

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:47.313 line:0%
-I like fall very much.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.015 line:0%
-I knew you were gonna say that!
Honestly, I knew it.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.349 line:0%
-Did you?

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:52.418 line:0%
-Have you taken down
your Christmas decorations yet?

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.086 line:0%
-Of course.

00:00:54.086 --> 00:00:55.321 line:0%
-Can you do a cartwheel?

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.723 line:0%
-I think I can, but my daughters
would say no,

00:00:57.723 --> 00:00:59.025 line:0%
but I'm working on it.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.594 line:0%
-Were you shy as a child?
-Yes.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.062 line:0%
-Do you still think
of yourself as shy?

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:04.363 line:0%
-Working on it.

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:07.066 line:0%
-Was one of your first films
called "BMX Bandits"?

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.200 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.503 line:0%
-Were you in the 1995 film
"Batman Forever"?

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:11.938 line:0%
-I was.

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.908 line:0%
-Can a text message ever have
too many exclamation points?

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.843 line:0%
-Yes,
and I'm probably guilty of it.

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:19.479 line:0%
-Do you have any pet alpacas?
-Yes.

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.447 line:0%
-Do you ever pet
your pet alpacas?

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:22.448 line:0%
-Kiss them.

00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:24.150 line:0%
-Are koalas cuter
than wallabies?

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.451 line:0%
-Yes.

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:29.054 line:0%
-Were you surprised
with how "The Undoing" ended?

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:30.089 line:0%
-No.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.191 line:0%
-Do you like country music?
-Yes.

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:34.828 line:0%
-Do you have any tattoos?
-No.

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:37.263 line:0%
-Have you ever gone skydiving?
-Yes.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.298 line:0%
-Have you ever done a keg stand?

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:40.500 line:0%
-No, I've not done that.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.301 line:0%
-Have you ever played beer pong?

00:01:42.301 --> 00:01:43.535 line:0%
-What's that?

00:01:43.535 --> 00:01:45.404 line:0%
-Do you think
you could beat me in beer pong?

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:46.873 line:0%
-I don't even know
how to play it,

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:49.108 line:0%
so I would never
be able to beat you.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:52.312 line:0%
-Is "Mario Kart" a good game
to play on a first date?

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:55.714 line:0%
Oh, come on.
-You tell me.

00:01:55.714 --> 00:01:57.516 line:0%
-Do you think there's
a chance that life

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:59.219 line:0%
is just a computer simulation?

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:04.623 line:0%
-No. Oh, that has no romance
to it at all.

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:06.059 line:0%
-Are sunsets better
than sunrises?

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:07.393 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.529 line:0%
-If given the chance,
would you want to go to Mars?

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.529 line:0%
-Yes.

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:12.098 line:0%
-Can you do 20 push-ups
in a row?

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:13.332 line:0%
-Yes.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:15.101 line:0%
-Was it intense to
work with legendary director

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.169 line:0%
Stanley Kubrick
in "Eyes Wide Shut"?

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:19.271 line:0%
-Yes, but extraordinary.

00:02:19.271 --> 00:02:21.674 line:0%
-Do you use emojis
when you text your friends?

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:22.674 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:02:22.674 --> 00:02:23.776 line:0%
-Do you put sugar
in your coffee?

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:24.910 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.179 line:0%
-Is pie pretty much
always better than cake,

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:29.114 line:0%
but we're all just
pretending otherwise?

00:02:29.114 --> 00:02:30.183 line:0%
-No.

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:32.217 line:0%
-Are you wearing
Chanel No. 5 right now?

00:02:32.217 --> 00:02:33.419 line:0%
-No.
[ Sniffs ]

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:34.821 line:0%
Musk and patchouli.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:37.090 line:0%
-Are you a neat freak?
-Occasionally.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.391 line:0%
-Are you a night owl?
-Yeah, turning into one.

00:02:39.391 --> 00:02:42.194 line:0%
-Is it ever okay
to eat pizza crust first?

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:45.131 line:0%
-Yeah, yeah, when it's
really crispy and thin.

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:47.233 line:0%
-Can you speak Russian?
-A little.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.435 line:0%
-Have you ever swam with sharks?
-Yes.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:51.637 line:0%
-Is it okay to take off
your shoes on a plane?

00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:54.273 line:0%
-And put on socks?

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:55.675 line:0%
-No, I think they meant, like,

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.143 line:0%
the people that
just take them right off.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.511 line:0%
-I'm so literal.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.647 line:0%
-Do you still have your outfits
from "Moulin Rouge!"?

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:01.980 line:0%
-No. I wish.

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.016 line:0%
-Is the greatest thing
you'll ever learn just to love

00:03:04.016 --> 00:03:05.351 line:0%
and be loved in return?

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:06.385 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:03:06.385 --> 00:03:08.154 line:0%
-Would you want to be
25% happier,

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:11.757 line:0%
but the catch is,
you have to walk 25% slower?

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:14.927 line:0%
-Mm...sure. I walk quite far.

00:03:14.927 --> 00:03:16.529 line:0%
Yeah, sure, I'd give that up.

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.664 line:0%
-Do you like road trips?

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.632 line:0%
-Yeah! Fabulous.

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:21.601 line:0%
-Are clowns scary?
-No.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.335 line:0%
-Have you ever been star-struck?

00:03:23.335 --> 00:03:26.105 line:0%
-Mm-hmm. Absolutely.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:27.806 line:0%
Right now.
-Thank you.

00:03:27.806 --> 00:03:29.976 line:0%
It took you too long.

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.144 line:0%
Do you sing in the shower?
-Yep.

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:34.447 line:0%
-Last question.
Would I look good in a fedora?

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:37.283 line:0%
-Mnh-mnh.
-We did it, 50 questions.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:39.618 line:0%
[ Dinging ]

00:03:39.618 --> 00:03:42.288
-That looks terrible!

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:43.789
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:46.725
-But how does
Duran Duran pull it off?

00:03:46.725 --> 00:03:49.762
And he looked cool.
-Did they?

00:03:49.762 --> 00:03:51.264
-Yes.
-Yeah, no, he did look cool.

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:52.465
Yeah.

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:54.867
-He's the best-looking dude
I've ever seen.

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:58.738
-You need a bigger hat.

00:03:58.738 --> 00:04:01.040
-It doesn't fit.
Bigger than this?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.208
-No, it looks too small.

00:04:03.208 --> 00:04:06.679
No, well, I mean, just
the whole thing doesn't work.

00:04:06.679 --> 00:04:12.485
It doesn't work.
Get it off quick! No!

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:15.554
You can definitely
get a better fedora than that!

00:04:15.554 --> 00:04:17.323
-What are you talking about?
-Who chose that?

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:20.092
What do you -- I think
you're out of your mind.

00:04:20.092 --> 00:04:21.527
This is, like, my thing,
I think.

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:25.064
-I think you are.
You're out of your mind.

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:29.368
-Oh, I can't believe that.

00:04:29.368 --> 00:04:30.903
I think this looks --
-Get it off!

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:33.806
-I think what would happen is,
people would go,

00:04:33.806 --> 00:04:35.141
"Are you wearing a hat?

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:37.509
[ Both laugh ]

00:04:37.509 --> 00:04:40.079
People wouldn't even realize
I'm wearing one.

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.080
They'd be like,
"Can I get you drink?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.281
What's up?

00:04:42.281 --> 00:04:43.582
And I'd go, "Oh, I thought
I brought my hat."

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:45.151
And I'd go, "Oh, where is it?
Oh, I'm wearing it."

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:48.554
-Then you'd turn and knock
somebody out with the brim.

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:50.289
-But if I wear it like that...

00:04:50.289 --> 00:04:53.225
-No. No. No.

00:04:53.225 --> 00:04:55.294
Just the whole thing
doesn't work.

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:56.829
-My thanks to Nicole Kidman.

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:59.265
"The Undoing"
is available now on HBO Max.

